    "detailed_description": "Shu's Misfortune is a sample RPG made in RPG Maker MZ by Moonana, the creator of the quirky RPG Virgo vs the Zodiac.<br><br>Shu wants to end her father's haute couture legacy by unraveling his empire of fashion. Shu is determined to embroider a most treacherous scheme that will put an end to this empire of threads and drought.<br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenging ATB combat where all decisions must be made quickly and swiftly.<br></li><li>Interact with all objects you can see in this tightly knit desert kingdom.<br></li><li>Around 1 hour long journey through what was once a fashionable society.<br></li><li>Lots of secrets, items and quests to be discovered.<br></li><li>Charming friends and foes to meet along the way.<br></li><li>One bonus track made by Elektrobear!</li></ul>",
